1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,641
Listen carefully, gentlemen.

2
00:00:04,691 --> 00:00:07,922
This examination is your ticket to the TOP.

3
00:00:07,972 --> 00:00:10,585
To pass, you need EIGHTY percent.

4
00:00:10,635 --> 00:00:13,354
Not 79.9.

5
00:00:13,404 --> 00:00:17,587
Not 79.9999.

6
00:00:17,637 --> 00:00:19,959
EIGHTY. PERCENT.

7
00:00:20,009 --> 00:00:23,381
You're either a WINNER... or a LOSER.

8
00:00:23,431 --> 00:00:25,152
Do your best.

9
00:00:25,252 --> 00:00:28,000
And BE with the best.

10
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,835
See you at the top, chief!

11
00:00:32,785 --> 00:00:33,989
Begin.

12
00:01:04,489 --> 00:01:09,017
