17
00:01:19,955 --> 00:01:22,284
...What other page?

18
00:01:22,934 --> 00:01:25,633
The one behind the statistics page. It was—

19
00:01:25,683 --> 00:01:33,433
(muffled) ...you know, with the network diagrams? And the systems part...

20
